WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:04.771
[indistinct chatter]

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.173
- [laughs]
YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:13.212
WHY YOU READIN', BITCH?

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:15.615
- BECAUSE I LIKE TO READ,
AND THIS IS A REALLY GOOD BOOK.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.451
- YOU'RE A REALLY GOOD BITCH,
BITCH.

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.186
- WHY YOU GOTTA
BOTHER ME, MAN?

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:22.221
- BECAUSE.
[dramatic piano music]

00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:24.424
I'M NOT DOING
VERY WELL IN SCHOOL.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.292
I'M READING
AT A THIRD-GRADE LEVEL.

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:28.795
I REALLY DON'T WANT
TO GET LEFT BACK,

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.963
SO WHEN I SEE SOMEBODY
READING FOR FUN,

00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:33.266
IT MAKES ME FEEL
THAT MUCH MORE STUPID!

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.269
AND THEN I GET MAD!
[music stops]

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.005
- UM, I DIDN'T
KNOW THAT. I--

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.373
THANKS SO MUCH
FOR OPENING UP TO ME--

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:41.607
- SHUT UP, QUEER!

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.409
- I DON'T UNDERSTAND.

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:44.710
WHY--I MEAN,
WHY YOU GOTTA GO THERE?

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:46.813
[piano music]

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.714
- I'VE BEEN HAVING
SEXUAL FANTASIES

00:00:48.747 --> 00:00:50.283
ABOUT SOME OF
THE OTHER GUYS AT SCHOOL.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.418
- WHAT?
- GIMME THAT!

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:54.654
I'M AFRAID OF THESE FEELINGS
AND WHAT THEY MIGHT MEAN.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.456
IT'S LIKE, BECAUSE
I HATE MYSELF SO MUCH,

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.157
I GOTTA
POINT THAT HATE OUTWARD

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.426
TOWARDS YOU!
[snickers]

00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:02.495
[music stops]

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:04.330
- YOU UNDERSTAND THIS
ON SUCH A DEEP LEVEL THAT--

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:06.165
- I DON'T UNDERSTAND [bleep]!
- WHOA!

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:08.034
- NOW I'M GONNA
PUNISH YOU PHYSICALLY

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.235
FOR ACKNOWLEDGING
MY EMOTIONAL PROBLEMS!

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:11.270
- WAIT, WAIT, WAIT,

00:01:11.303 --> 00:01:13.339
I WAS GONNA SAY IF YOU
UNDERSTAND YOURSELF SO WELL,

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:15.108
THEN MAYBE YOU SHOULD
TRY WORKING ON CHANGING IT.

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.043
- OF COURSE
I WANT TO CHANGE IT!

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.278
BUT IT'S THE ONLY
DEFENSE MECHANISM I HAVE

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.214
AGAINST DEEPER, MORE TERRIFYING
PROBLEMS BURIED INSIDE OF ME!

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.715
[brakes squeak]

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.187
YOU'RE LUCKY MY DAD'S HERE.
[piano music]

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.456
- [banging]
GET IN THE DAMN TRUCK, SON.

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:32.859
I NEED TO TAKE YOU HOME AND BEAT
ON YOU 'CAUSE I HATE MYSELF.

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.128
AND YOU LOOK LIKE
YOUR MOTHER WHO LEFT ME.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.029
THEN I'M GONNA BLOCK OUT
THE GUILT I FEEL

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:39.632
OVER MISTREATING YOU
WITH A RIVER OF VODKA.

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.634
- I'M GONNA INTERNALIZE THAT

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:43.369
AND UNKNOWINGLY TRANSFER IT
ONTO YOU TOMORROW.

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:48.841
♪ ♪

00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:51.344
COMING RELUCTANTLY.

